    "domain": "Sorting & searching",
    "notionUrl": "https://app.notion.com/p/2e392ab76d40806c873ac58c7f3d77a3",
    "content": "## std::sort\n也就是直接sort\n用法：\n```c++\nsort(it.begin,it.end,附加條件);//從小排到大\n```\n加上greater\\<型態\\>();可以從大排到小\n### stable_sort\n保證原本順序的sort\n## merge_sort\n```c++\nvoid combine(vector<int> &v, int l, int mid, int r) \n{\n    vector<int> tmp;\n    int i = l , j = mid + 1;\n    while(i <= mid && j <= r)\n    {\n    if(v[i] >= v[j])\n    {\n    tmp.push_back(v[i]);\n    i++;\n    }\n    else \n    {\n    tmp.push_back(v[j]);\n    j++;\n}\n}\nwhile(i <= mid)\n{\ntmp.push_back(v[i]);\ni++;\n}\nwhile(j <= r)\n{\ntmp.push_back(v[j]);\nj++;\n}\nfor(int k = 0 ; k < tmp.size(); k++)\n{\nv[l+k] = tmp[k];\n}\n}\nvoid merge_sort(vector<int> &v, int l, int r) \n{\n    if (l == r) return;\n    int mid = (l+r) / 2;\n    merge_sort(v, l, mid);\n    merge_sort(v, mid+1, r);\n    combine(v, l, mid, r);\n}\n呼叫\nmerge_sort(v,0,v.size()-1);\n\n```\n\n### 複雜度\n$$\n\n$$\n\n## quick_sort\n選一個數字當 pivot，把比他小的放一邊；比他大的放另一邊，之後遞迴\n```c++\nvoid quick_sort(vector<int> &v) \n{\n    vector<int> left, right;\n    int pivot = 0;\n    for(int i = 0;i<v.size();i++) \n    {\n        if (i == 0) continue;\n        else if(v[i] >= v[pivot]) right.push_back(v[i]);\n        else left.push_back(v[i]);\n    }\n    quick_sort(left);\n    quick_sort(right);\n    int x = v[pivot];\n    for(int i = 0;i<left.size();i++) v[i] = left[i];\n    if (left.size() != v.size()) v[left.size()] = x;\n    for(int i = 0;i<right.size();i++) v[left.size() + 1 + i] = right[i];\n    return;\n}\n\n```\n\n### 複雜度\n$O(NlogN)$\n\n# 離散化\n```c++\nvector<int> a(n);\nfor(int i = 0 ; i < n ; i++) cin >> a[i];\n\nauto b = a;\nsort(b.begin(),b.end());\nb.erase(unique(b.begin(),b.end(),b.end()); // 去重\nfor(int i = 0 ; i < n ; i++) \na[i] = lower_bound(b.begin(),b.end(),a[i]) - b.begin() + 1;\n```\na = \\{ 1e9, 2 , 2 ,1003 , 2e3 \\}\nb = \\{ 2 , 1003 , 2e3 , 1e9 \\} \na\\[0\\] = 4\na\\[1\\] = 1\na\\[2\\] = 2\na\\[3\\] = 3\na = \\{ 4 , 1 , 2 , 3 \\}"
